---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "@/components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "@/components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Kit Lists | Peaks + Puddles"
  description="Curated index of where to get the best layers for your kids"
>
  <Header />
  <main id="main-content" class="mx-auto w-full max-w-3xl px-4 pb-12 pt-8">
    <article class="app-prose max-w-none">
      <h1>Kit Lists For The Outdoors</h1>
      <p>
        Finding genuine technical kids' outdoor gear in the UK isn't always easy—high street "waterproofs" often soak through after twenty minutes on wet grass, while specialist Scandinavian brands can be tricky to track down. Below are the trusted UK retailers, Nordic stockists, and pre-loved marketplaces we actually use for forest nursery and winter mountain kit.
      </p>

      <h2>Specialist Kids' Outdoor &amp; Forest School Retailers</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Little Adventure Shop:</strong> One of the best UK one-stop shops for Scandinavian and British forest school kit, stocking Didriksons, Reima, Muddy Puddles, and Spotty Otter.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Outdoor Kids:</strong> Great range of technical waterproof dungarees, insulated mittens, and thermal wellies with reliable UK shipping.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Scandi Mini / Scandinavian Outdoor Stockists:</strong> Ideal for tracking down genuine Nordic wool-blend base layers, balaclavas, and high-hydrostatic-head snowsuits.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        <em>
          Transparency note: Some retailer links on this site are affiliate links. If you click through and buy something, we may earn a small commission at no extra cost to you.
        </em>
      </p>
    </article>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>